{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >For the English demo, please check the demo store page.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How to download the English demo:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visit the demo store page. You can search for &quot;The Game of The Playful demo&quot; in the Steam store.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add the demo to your library.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In your library, right-click on the demo and select <strong>Properties</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go to the <strong>Betas</strong> tab and select the branch you wish to opt into. Choose <strong>&quot;VersionEnglish&quot;</strong> to download the English demo.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wait for the auto-update to finish downloading.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We recommend verifying the integrity of your game files, especially after switching branches.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you for visiting this page!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >===</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Game of The Playful</strong> is a visual novel developed entirely by a single individual, with character artwork contributed by external artists. The game was created with the Visual Novel Maker engine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You assume the role of the heroine and embark on sixteen distinct, standalone stories. Each narrative focuses on building a connection\u2014be it a friendship or a romantic relationship\u2014with one specific character. As the stories are independent of one another, your journey in each is dedicated solely to that character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game style and atmosphere:\u00a0I aim to create a gentle, healing atmosphere that encourages empathy with the sorrow in the storylines. The game includes 16 individual story routes, each with a different female protagonist and her own independent identity and ending. Most stories involve the heroine confronting past trauma, and since each has a different background, their traumatic experiences vary. The overall tone is therapeutic, guiding players to face life with positivity and optimism. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most routes include both a friendship and a romantic ending with the male lead, and some have up to five endings (such as &quot;Death Bad End&quot; and &quot;Stranger Bad End&quot;), bringing the total to 40 so far. Player choices determine the outcome. I hope players feel a sense of gentle care, healing, and deep emotion throughout the game.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1359440?t=1762261157","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1359440/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762261157","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1359440/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762261157","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1359440/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762261157","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":"The game contains suggested themes. \r\nThe game does not have nude pictures. Suggested themes are discribed in an implicit way.\r\nAll characters in the game are over 18 years old."},"demos":[{"appid":1365790,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >For the English demo, please check the demo store page.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How to download the English demo:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visit the demo store page. You can search for &quot;The Game of The Playful demo&quot; in the Steam store.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add the demo to your library.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In your library, right-click on the demo and select <strong>Properties</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go to the <strong>Betas</strong> tab and select the branch you wish to opt into. Choose <strong>&quot;VersionEnglish&quot;</strong> to download the English demo.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wait for the auto-update to finish downloading.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We recommend verifying the integrity of your game files, especially after switching branches.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you for visiting this page!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >===</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Game of The Playful</strong> is a visual novel developed entirely by a single individual, with character artwork contributed by external artists. The game was created with the Visual Novel Maker engine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You assume the role of the heroine and embark on sixteen distinct, standalone stories. Each narrative focuses on building a connection\u2014be it a friendship or a romantic relationship\u2014with one specific character. As the stories are independent of one another, your journey in each is dedicated solely to that character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game style and atmosphere:\u00a0I aim to create a gentle, healing atmosphere that encourages empathy with the sorrow in the storylines. The game includes 16 individual story routes, each with a different female protagonist and her own independent identity and ending. Most stories involve the heroine confronting past trauma, and since each has a different background, their traumatic experiences vary. The overall tone is therapeutic, guiding players to face life with positivity and optimism. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most routes include both a friendship and a romantic ending with the male lead, and some have up to five endings (such as &quot;Death Bad End&quot; and &quot;Stranger Bad End&quot;), bringing the total to 40 so far. Player choices determine the outcome. I hope players feel a sense of gentle care, healing, and deep emotion throughout the game.</p>","developers":["\u6df1\u84dd\u5236\u4f5c\u7ec4"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1359440/header.jpg?t=1762261157","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1359440/1770214531/d6d3360576cbbb1ac99b2c6bb79dfbfa1aff09dd/1759409935/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759410394","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1359440/1770214531/d6d3360576cbbb1ac99b2c6bb79dfbfa1aff09dd/1759409935/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759410394","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1359440/1770214531/d6d3360576cbbb1ac99b2c6bb79dfbfa1aff09dd/1759409935/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1759410394","id":257175810,"name":"The Game of The Playful PV","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257175810/dfe93f1308c31d3ee26abf3c330a9baaf0978de7/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1759410394"}],"name":"The Game of The Playful","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7/8/10/11 64 bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> \u65e0\u7279\u6b8a\u8981\u6c42<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space<b